# Contributor skills. Dependency skill installers may add skills to
# .agents/skills/ (and, via the .claude/skills symlink, Claude-specific
# installs land there too), so only the skills listed here are tracked.
# Update this list when adding or removing a skill.
/.agents/*
!/.agents/skills/
/.agents/skills/*
!/.agents/skills/memory-bank/
